WEBVTT

00:40:26.288 --> 00:40:30.413
I think that's such a heartening message
to say I will not be browbeaten by this.

00:40:30.829 --> 00:40:35.788
Yeah. I mean, I wouldn't let the Trumps
and balseros browbeat me into saying,

00:40:35.996 --> 00:40:38.996
well, they've done so much damage,
there's nothing I can do.

00:40:38.996 --> 00:40:41.829
So I'm not going to do anything.
That's the danger.

00:40:42.454 --> 00:40:46.913
People do nothing because they feel
powerless and helpless and hopeless.

00:40:47.663 --> 00:40:50.329
And that's why I started the
youth program recently,

00:40:50.329 --> 00:40:55.579
which because so many young people telling
me that they felt depressed

00:40:55.579 --> 00:40:59.663
or angry or mostly apathetic because
we've compromised their future,

00:40:59.954 --> 00:41:01.621
there's nothing they can do about it.